shape: sequence_diagram

title: Reorder {
  near: top-center
  shape: text
  style.font-size: 20
}

person: Person
client: Web or Android
api: Function App
cosmos: Cosmos

person -> client: Drag an item
client -> client: Renumber positions on the affected dates
client -> api: POST /items/changes, each item with its etag
api -> api: Check the token. Reject if any etag is missing
api -> cosmos: Write every listed item, or none
cosmos -> api: Stored
api -> client: The saved items and new etags
client -> client: Show the new order
